---
description: Collectors Toolkit project conventions and module map
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` before making changes. Follow existing patterns in `src/lib/` and API routes.

- Auth: Clerk → `getOrCreateUserId` → Supabase queries scoped by `users.id`
- Server DB: `createServiceClient()` only; RLS is deny-all on user tables
- Migrations: `supabase/migrations/001`–`007` — apply via `supabase db push` or Supabase MCP
- Tests: `npm test` after logic changes; `npm run lint` and `npm run build` before PRs
- Product scope: MVP (weeks 1–8) is shipped; see `collectors_toolkit_product_spec.md` for V2 only
